<title>USA: FREE-TO-TRADE - Walled Lake CSD, Mich..</title>
<headline>FREE-TO-TRADE - Walled Lake CSD, Mich..</headline>
<text>
<p>WALLED LAKE CONSOLIDATED SCHOOL DISTRICT</p>
<p>RE: $129,085,000</p>
<p>COUNTY OF OAKLAND, MICHIGAN</p>
<p>1996 SCHOOL BUILDING &amp; SITE REFUNDING BONDS</p>
